           <http://ld.company.org/prod-vocab/price> ?price .
  ?supplier <http://ld.company.org/prod-vocab/country> ?country .
  FILTER (?country IN (<http://dbpedia.org/resource/France>, <http://dbpedia.org/resource/Germany>))
